       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RUNNINGTOTAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 AMOUNTS.
          05 AMT PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 AMOUNTS-INIT REDEFINES AMOUNTS PIC X(15).
       01 RUNNING PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 IDX     PIC 9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "010025100005050" TO AMOUNTS-INIT
           PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IDX > 5
               ADD AMT(IDX) TO RUNNING
               DISPLAY "AFTER ITEM " IDX ": " RUNNING
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
